# Secrets — never commit (NFR-4, acceptance criterion 12)
.env
# A scratch file for pasting the Groq key, staged into .env. Same secret, same rule.
# Listed explicitly because `.env` in a gitignore matches that path and not `.env.txt`.
.env.txt

